9: Lemma call_post:forall m bo bi po pi f,Inputs m bo bi po pi f->forall t result mf,star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args bo bi po pi)m)t(Returnstate result Kstop mf)->result=Result f/\Post m mf bo bi po pi f.
10: Proof. intros m bo bi po pi f IN t result mf PATH;destruct(call_summary m bo bi po pi f IN)as[after[EX[POST[SAFE ALL]]]];destruct(ALL t result mf PATH)as[R M];subst result mf;auto. Qed.
11: Lemma copy_guard_proved:forall k,CopyGuard k.
12: Proof. intros k m src dst PRE;pose proof(copy_pre_safety m src dst PRE)as[NE A B EN C D SEP RD WR].
13:  destruct k as[|[|[|[|[|[|[|[|k]]]]]]]];simpl;auto;intros order[EQ Q];congruence. Qed.
14: Lemma case_status:forall f expected,Result f=expected->CaseStatus f expected.
15: Proof. intros f expected EQ m bo bi po pi IN t result mf PATH;rewrite(proj1(call_post m bo bi po pi f IN t result mf PATH));exact EQ. Qed.
16: Lemma case_words:forall f words,Reject f=false->map(fun i=>Float32.to_bits(Output f i))[0;1;2;3]=map Int.repr words->CaseWords f words.
17: Proof. intros f words REJ WORD m bo bi pi IN t result mf PATH dst bytes obs READ STORE.
18:  pose proof(proj2(call_post m bo bi Ptrofs.zero pi f IN t result mf PATH))as POST.
19:  transitivity(map(fun i=>Some(Vint(Float32.to_bits(Output f i))))[0;1;2;3]).
20:  - apply map_ext_in;intros i INDEX;eapply successful_copy_words;[exact POST|exact REJ|exact READ|exact STORE|];simpl in INDEX;repeat destruct INDEX as[EQ|INDEX];try contradiction;subst i;lia.
21:  - change(map(fun w=>Some(Vint w))(map(fun i=>Float32.to_bits(Output f i))[0;1;2;3])=map(fun w=>Some(Vint(Int.repr w)))words);rewrite WORD,map_map;reflexivity. Qed.
22: Lemma case_preserves:forall f,Reject f=true->CasePreserves f.
23: Proof. intros f REJ m bo bi po pi IN t result mf PATH;destruct(proj2(call_post m bo bi po pi f IN t result mf PATH))as[W[RD[FR[VB[BY AC]]]]];rewrite REJ in BY;exact BY. Qed.
24: Lemma assertion_1:Assertion1.
25: Proof. intros m bo bi po pi f IN t result mf PATH;rewrite(proj1(call_post m bo bi po pi f IN t result mf PATH));unfold Result;destruct(Reject f);auto. Qed.
26: Lemma assertion_2:Assertion2.
27: Proof. intros m bo bi pi f before after IN BEFORE AFTER t result mf PATH.
28:  destruct(proj2(call_post m bo bi(Ptrofs.repr 4)pi f IN t result mf PATH))as[W[RD[FR REST]]].
29:  assert(VO:Mem.valid_block m bo)by(destruct IN as[NE[WO RI]];exact(writable_valid m bo(Ptrofs.repr 4)4 ltac:(lia)WO)).
30:  split;[exact FR|];split.
31:  - eapply(frame_load_kept m mf bo(Ptrofs.repr 4)bo 0 Mint32(Vint before));[exact FR|exact VO|right;left;change(0+4<=4);lia|exact BEFORE].
32:  - eapply(frame_load_kept m mf bo(Ptrofs.repr 4)bo 20 Mint32(Vint after));[exact FR|exact VO|right;right;change(4+16<=20);lia|exact AFTER]. Qed.
